WEBVTT

00:00.116 --> 00:03.483
Episode 5
A Destiny

00:12.362 --> 00:13.852
This is the best!

00:13.964 --> 00:16.899
It just has to be
Petit Rondo's Cookies & Cream!

00:17.000 --> 00:19.798
This was really worth
the 30 minute wait!

00:19.903 --> 00:20.801
Here!

00:22.005 --> 00:23.097
That's right...

00:23.206 --> 00:24.605
It's a shame.

00:24.708 --> 00:28.144
It'd be wonderful if you could
eat this with me, Inuki...

00:28.244 --> 00:29.871
Don't worry, Inuki.

00:29.980 --> 00:32.073
Even if you don't know
how Petit Rondo tastes...

00:32.182 --> 00:34.275
...I still love you, Inuki!

00:34.384 --> 00:35.282
Um...

00:37.287 --> 00:39.585
If you're bored,
how about some tea with me?

00:41.658 --> 00:43.148
I know a good place.

00:43.259 --> 00:45.022
A shop that has great cakes.

00:45.128 --> 00:48.564
- Really?
- I'm sure you'd really like it.

00:48.665 --> 00:49.927
Want to try it out?

00:52.469 --> 00:54.266
I want to ask you one thing.

00:54.371 --> 00:55.497
What?

00:55.605 --> 00:57.072
Can you see him?

01:02.078 --> 01:02.976
"Him"?

01:04.481 --> 01:06.312
Then it's all right.

01:06.416 --> 01:07.474
See ya!

01:07.584 --> 01:09.484
H-Hey, what are
you talking about?

01:09.586 --> 01:11.383
Don't make fun of me!

01:11.488 --> 01:12.648
Where are you going?

01:13.723 --> 01:15.588
A little trip to the Diet Building.

01:15.692 --> 01:18.024
The Diet Building?

01:18.128 --> 01:19.026
For what?

01:21.965 --> 01:25.264
To talk a bit about
the end of the world.

01:26.536 --> 01:28.060
Let's go, Inuki.

01:28.171 --> 01:29.195
It's all right.

01:29.305 --> 01:32.866
I make it a point not to date
anyone who can't see you.

01:37.414 --> 01:38.574
Come on, go get it!

01:41.751 --> 01:43.275
All right. Well done.

01:48.792 --> 01:49.656
Hey, wait!

01:50.727 --> 01:53.787
There really isn't anyone
that can see you after all.

01:58.702 --> 02:03.162
Grandma,
everyone calls me a liar.

02:04.774 --> 02:07.334
Everyone tells me
they can't see Inuki.

02:08.411 --> 02:10.641
Inuki is right here, too!

02:11.715 --> 02:14.149
Everyone says I'm lying...

02:16.720 --> 02:18.984
Inuki really does exist.

02:19.089 --> 02:21.023
Right by your side.

02:21.124 --> 02:23.684
It's just that everyone else
can't see him.

02:23.793 --> 02:24.851
Why?

02:24.961 --> 02:26.656
Why can't they see him?

02:26.763 --> 02:29.596
Why am I the only one
who can see him?

02:29.699 --> 02:34.466
That's because Inuki is
a dog born just for you...

02:34.571 --> 02:37.938
...who will spend his
entire life at your side.

02:38.041 --> 02:40.737
Don't the other kids
have ones like him?

02:40.844 --> 02:42.243
No, they don't.

02:42.345 --> 02:45.246
That is a power
that only you have.

02:45.348 --> 02:47.213
I don't want power like that!

02:47.317 --> 02:50.912
I want you to make Inuki so that
everyone else can see him, too!

02:51.020 --> 02:52.749
I can't do that.

02:54.691 --> 02:59.355
For with that power of yours,
you will become one of the stars...

02:59.462 --> 03:02.056
...who will determine
the fate of this world.

03:06.903 --> 03:09.804
But maybe the ones I meet
in the Diet Building...

03:09.906 --> 03:11.737
...will be able to see you.

03:11.841 --> 03:14.139
That's what Grandma said.

03:14.244 --> 03:18.305
If that's the case, neither you
nor I will continue to feel lonely.

03:18.414 --> 03:21.611
I really hope others will
be able to pet you, Inuki.

03:28.491 --> 03:29.389
Huh?

03:38.401 --> 03:39.299
Mama!

03:46.276 --> 03:47.903
W-What happened?

03:48.011 --> 03:49.842
Are you all right?
No injuries?

03:49.946 --> 03:51.379
What the hell's going on?

03:52.882 --> 03:54.315
Great job, Inuki.

03:56.352 --> 03:57.319
Well, let's go.

03:57.420 --> 03:58.318
Sure.

03:59.422 --> 04:00.514
Great dog.

04:01.724 --> 04:02.588
Good job.

04:03.660 --> 04:05.093
Good dog.

04:05.195 --> 04:07.493
That's a good dog.

04:07.597 --> 04:10.225
A strange dog,
but a good dog.

04:14.604 --> 04:15.901
H-Hey...

04:16.005 --> 04:17.336
Is something wrong,
little lady?

04:26.082 --> 04:28.573
Did I do something bad?

04:31.588 --> 04:32.816
Sorry.

04:32.922 --> 04:35.948
I apologize.
It's nothing.

04:36.059 --> 04:37.390
I see...

04:37.493 --> 04:39.085
Are you all right?

04:39.195 --> 04:40.093
Yes...

04:41.297 --> 04:42.787
Well, I'll be going now.

04:46.102 --> 04:47.763
There really was
someone, Inuki.

04:47.871 --> 04:49.668
Someone who can
really see you...

05:09.425 --> 05:11.950
You're still debating?

05:12.061 --> 05:16.395
If it's a good thing for Kamui
and me to meet the princess or not.

05:16.499 --> 05:19.263
It's all right.
It'll be all right.

05:19.369 --> 05:23.328
The princess should be fully aware
that we're headed her way.

05:23.439 --> 05:25.634
That's 'cause she's
the dreaming princess...

05:25.742 --> 05:29.041
...who's controlled all of Japan's
political affairs from the shadows.

05:30.113 --> 05:31.205
I will say this first.

05:32.282 --> 05:34.910
Princess Hinoto
has a handicapped body.

05:35.018 --> 05:39.284
She cannot see, hear,
speak, nor walk.

05:40.423 --> 05:42.914
Please make sure
to not be rude to her.

05:43.026 --> 05:44.050
I see.

05:44.160 --> 05:46.424
Then how do you talk to her?

05:46.529 --> 05:49.589
If you talk to her normally,
she will answer.

05:49.699 --> 05:51.223
Within your heart.

05:51.334 --> 05:52.596
I see...

05:52.702 --> 05:53.600
Then that's fine.

05:55.371 --> 05:56.463
Princess Hinoto.

05:57.573 --> 05:59.404
Please, do come in.

06:04.180 --> 06:05.647
I have been waiting for you.

06:07.116 --> 06:08.481
Kamui.

06:08.584 --> 06:10.518
And the visitor from Kouya.

06:11.621 --> 06:13.282
Now, come closer.

06:13.389 --> 06:14.617
You're right.

06:14.724 --> 06:16.487
It looks like she's
speaking normally.

06:33.876 --> 06:36.470
I apologize for my lack
of manners earlier.

06:36.579 --> 06:38.274
So it was you.

06:38.381 --> 06:40.679
The one who was watching me.

06:40.783 --> 06:42.978
What, this isn't the first time?

06:43.086 --> 06:44.212
No.

06:44.320 --> 06:47.084
I wished to know
what Kamui looked like...

06:47.190 --> 06:48.782
...and used a vision spell.

06:53.329 --> 06:56.594
However, Kamui noticed me
using the spell.

06:58.301 --> 07:00.326
Nothing less from Kamui.

07:01.871 --> 07:02.803
So you're still alive?

07:04.240 --> 07:07.232
Come on,
calm and peaceful here...

07:07.343 --> 07:09.174
All right?

07:09.278 --> 07:10.472
The star from Kouya.

07:11.781 --> 07:14.614
Thank you for
bringing Kamui here.

07:15.718 --> 07:19.552
I have been eagerly awaiting the day
that I would get to meet you.

07:19.655 --> 07:23.614
Well, you make me blush
if you say that, Princess.

07:23.726 --> 07:26.889
I think I'm a bit lucky myself
to meet the dreaming princess.

07:26.996 --> 07:32.298
I mean, that stubborn old stargazer
really was fond of you.

07:33.636 --> 07:35.467
I think I like you, too.

07:37.173 --> 07:40.836
Besides, you look much younger
than your actual age.

07:43.212 --> 07:45.043
I mean it.

07:45.148 --> 07:46.547
Well, Kamui.

07:46.649 --> 07:49.243
You have a lot of things
you want to know.

07:49.352 --> 07:50.614
Have the princess tell you.

07:52.355 --> 07:53.344
Do you know...

07:54.724 --> 07:56.749
...what I really am?

07:59.595 --> 08:00.493
Tell me.

08:03.232 --> 08:05.223
Now, give me your hand.

08:07.203 --> 08:08.693
Rest assured.

08:08.805 --> 08:10.636
If something happens to you...

08:10.740 --> 08:13.334
...I'll physically jump in
and do something.

08:13.443 --> 08:15.343
That's my destiny.

08:19.582 --> 08:21.482
I will show you.

08:21.584 --> 08:22.778
About the Earth...

08:23.986 --> 08:25.078
About the future...

08:26.756 --> 08:28.155
And Kamui...

08:30.259 --> 08:31.521
...about yourself.

08:47.477 --> 08:52.005
This land, Tokyo, is the key
to supporting the Earth.

08:52.115 --> 08:56.552
There are many barriers created
artificially by man in this area.

08:56.652 --> 08:58.279
The Yamanote Line...

08:58.387 --> 09:02.289
...a "thread barrier" drawn in
the shape of Buddha's hand...

09:02.391 --> 09:05.383
...with the Imperial Palace
in its center, to protect Tokyo.

09:05.495 --> 09:09.625
Shinjuku's skyscrapers,
a group of giant barrier stones.

09:09.732 --> 09:13.566
And other foundations that support
an unstable ground.

09:14.937 --> 09:17.098
The powers of these barriers...

09:17.206 --> 09:19.800
...have been called
the Dragons of Heaven.

09:19.909 --> 09:22.537
And these
are the Dragons of Earth...

09:23.613 --> 09:27.913
the power to break these barriers
and destroy the world.

09:28.017 --> 09:32.613
The ones who lead those powers
are called the Seven Angels.

09:34.090 --> 09:38.356
And only the Seven Seals
can stop them...

09:38.461 --> 09:40.827
...and protect
the Dragons of Heaven.

09:42.098 --> 09:44.396
The Dragons of Heaven,
the Seven Seals...

09:44.500 --> 09:47.628
...and the Dragons of Earth,
the Seven Angels' battle...

09:47.737 --> 09:50.706
That is the battle
for the End of the World.

09:52.708 --> 09:55.438
If the Dragons of Earth
defeat the Dragons of Heaven...

09:55.545 --> 09:57.035
...the world will be destroyed.

09:58.481 --> 10:00.972
This is the future that I saw.

10:11.260 --> 10:12.522
Kamui...

10:12.628 --> 10:15.722
You can change this future.

10:16.832 --> 10:21.531
Guide the Seven Seals
and save us from this future.

10:21.637 --> 10:23.104
Me?

10:23.206 --> 10:26.505
You should already
have realized those powers.

10:26.609 --> 10:30.409
The ones that hold the key
to the end of this world.

10:30.513 --> 10:35.815
That is why your mother took you
as a young child and left Tokyo.

10:35.918 --> 10:37.749
To await your growth.

10:37.853 --> 10:42.483
And to prevent the catastrophes
that will now fall upon you...

10:42.592 --> 10:45.322
...she passed away
as your Shadow Sacrifice.

10:52.935 --> 10:55.233
I understand
how hard it must be.

10:57.073 --> 11:00.099
However, you cannot waste
your mother's will.

11:01.210 --> 11:04.236
That is hidden within your name.

11:05.715 --> 11:07.307
Kamui.

11:07.416 --> 11:09.748
The one who carries out
the majesty of God.

11:09.852 --> 11:12.184
It means you will carry out...

11:12.288 --> 11:15.724
...the power and will of God
and save this world.

11:15.825 --> 11:17.087
And...

11:17.193 --> 11:19.923
..."the one who hunts
the majesty of God."

11:20.029 --> 11:23.556
Don't you go off on your own
like that, my sister Hinoto.

11:23.666 --> 11:26.931
And it's awfully unfair
not telling him crucial facts.

11:27.036 --> 11:28.128
Who are you?

11:29.238 --> 11:31.138
Nice to meet you, Kamui.

11:31.240 --> 11:33.208
I am Kanoe.

11:33.309 --> 11:35.038
Younger sister to Hinoto.

11:36.579 --> 11:40.640
I'm not a dreamseer, but I can enter
other people's dreams.

11:41.717 --> 11:45.084
I watch the dreams
that my sister sees.

11:45.187 --> 11:46.518
Stop it, Kanoe!

11:46.622 --> 11:48.317
Get out of my dream!

11:48.424 --> 11:49.857
Tell me.

11:49.959 --> 11:53.417
There are two meanings
for the name "Kamui."

11:53.529 --> 11:55.622
"The one who hunts
the majesty of God."

11:55.731 --> 11:59.292
In other words, the one who hunts
those given God's power...

11:59.402 --> 12:01.165
...and destroys the world.

12:02.238 --> 12:06.174
So you do have the potential
to be a Dragon of Heaven...

12:06.275 --> 12:08.641
...but you also could
be a Dragon of Earth.

12:08.744 --> 12:10.541
What do you mean by that?

12:10.646 --> 12:12.705
You have two futures.

12:13.849 --> 12:17.444
One as a Dragon of Heaven,
the other as a Dragon of Earth.

12:17.553 --> 12:21.990
Even Hinoto, who has not once
predicted the future incorrectly...

12:22.091 --> 12:24.150
...could not determine
your future.

12:25.294 --> 12:28.092
That dream was one
that works better for her.

12:28.197 --> 12:29.960
Don't you want to see
the other future?

12:30.066 --> 12:31.397
Kanoe!

12:31.500 --> 12:32.694
The other future?

12:33.769 --> 12:34.667
Yes...

12:37.940 --> 12:38.838
Wait!

12:42.712 --> 12:43.610
Kamui!

12:43.713 --> 12:44.771
Get a grip, Kamui!

12:47.249 --> 12:48.409
Are you all right, Kamui?

12:48.517 --> 12:49.984
- Princess...
- Princess!

12:57.093 --> 12:59.926
Why did you interrupt my
conversation with that woman?

13:03.999 --> 13:05.899
Were you going to trick me?

13:06.001 --> 13:07.366
I-It's not that...

13:08.537 --> 13:11.199
Stop it!
Let go of Princess Hinoto!

13:11.307 --> 13:12.239
You...

13:12.341 --> 13:13.239
...shut up!

13:15.111 --> 13:16.078
Hold on a sec.

13:17.413 --> 13:20.712
There are no lies
in the dream I showed you.

13:20.816 --> 13:21.976
That is the truth.

13:23.085 --> 13:27.715
But the other dream that Kanoe
mentioned also exists.

13:27.823 --> 13:29.154
Why are there two futures?

13:29.258 --> 13:31.624
Because you are Kamui.

13:32.695 --> 13:36.290
If you choose the Dragons of Earth,
the world will be destroyed.

13:36.399 --> 13:40.563
And if you choose the Dragons of Heaven,
the world will be saved.

13:40.669 --> 13:44.298
It is all because you will choose
which future will take place.

13:44.407 --> 13:46.272
I'll decide the future?

13:47.376 --> 13:48.274
Yes.

13:55.818 --> 13:58.446
You're saying that
I'll decide the future?

14:00.456 --> 14:01.946
Ridiculous.

14:02.057 --> 14:04.082
I don't care about the future.

14:04.193 --> 14:06.957
I have no interest
in saving this world.

14:07.062 --> 14:09.622
Besides, I don't fully
trust you, either!

14:09.732 --> 14:12.599
If I have enough power
to decide the future...

14:12.701 --> 14:15.636
...why didn't you hurry up
and give me the Divine Sword?

14:15.738 --> 14:17.899
If I had
the Divine Sword in hand...

14:18.007 --> 14:21.909
...the shrinemaster of Togakushi
Shrine wouldn't be where he is!

14:22.011 --> 14:22.943
Am I wrong?

14:24.380 --> 14:25.506
Answer me!

14:26.949 --> 14:28.041
I don't approve...

14:29.318 --> 14:32.879
I will never approve
of you as "Kamui!"

14:32.988 --> 14:34.455
What was that?

14:34.557 --> 14:36.855
I am not one
of the Seven Seals...

14:36.959 --> 14:39.860
...unlike Lady Arashi
or the one from Kouya.

14:39.962 --> 14:43.762
I am only given the duty
of protecting Princess Hinoto.

14:43.866 --> 14:46.232
However, even from my eyes...

14:46.335 --> 14:49.930
...you do not possess a personality
fit to be called "Kamui."

14:50.039 --> 14:51.006
You are rotten!

14:52.074 --> 14:52.904
So what?

14:57.146 --> 14:59.979
This time, I'll make sure
to finish you off.

15:00.082 --> 15:01.447
Calm down, Kamui!

15:01.550 --> 15:02.482
Stop it!

15:02.585 --> 15:03.677
Shut up.

15:03.786 --> 15:06.016
I don't like each
and every one of you!

15:08.891 --> 15:10.290
W-What is that?

15:17.199 --> 15:18.791
A dog spirit.

15:18.901 --> 15:20.163
It appears...

15:20.269 --> 15:24.103
...a Dragon of Heaven, another of
the Seven Seals has arrived.

15:29.478 --> 15:31.275
Excuse me!

15:31.380 --> 15:33.439
I'm Yuzuriha Nekoi
of Mitsumine Shrine!

15:33.549 --> 15:34.948
I'm 14 years old!

15:37.753 --> 15:39.243
Nice to meet you!

15:39.355 --> 15:40.947
Best regards for the future!

15:41.056 --> 15:42.887
I'm Yuzuriha Nekoi!

15:42.992 --> 15:44.254
This is amazing!

15:44.360 --> 15:47.420
All of these people
can see you too, Inuki!

15:47.530 --> 15:50.465
Well, I was all right
up till the Diet Building.

15:50.566 --> 15:54.366
I didn't know where I should enter,
so I had Inuki guide me.

15:55.538 --> 15:56.436
Hello!

15:56.539 --> 15:58.473
You must be Ms. Hinoto!

15:58.574 --> 15:59.472
Yes.

16:02.811 --> 16:03.709
Here!

16:05.247 --> 16:07.340
People get cranky
when they're hungry.

16:09.418 --> 16:11.386
Oh? It's delicious...

16:11.487 --> 16:13.387
Missie, don't worry about it.

16:13.489 --> 16:15.650
Kamui's just in
a slightly foul mood.

16:15.758 --> 16:17.020
What?

16:17.126 --> 16:19.060
This is "the" Kamui?

16:19.161 --> 16:20.594
I see...

16:20.696 --> 16:22.163
I'm surprised!

16:22.264 --> 16:23.993
I thought "Kamui"
would be more...

16:25.334 --> 16:26.198
Missie...

16:26.302 --> 16:28.236
Looks like someone
was on your tail.

16:28.337 --> 16:29.235
What?

16:35.744 --> 16:38.235
It's an illusion
created by someone.

16:38.347 --> 16:42.477
A rather tense moment as soon as
we arrive, huh, Inuki?

16:42.585 --> 16:45.816
It looks like we'll be busy,
just like Grandma said.

16:45.921 --> 16:48.082
The doings of an Angel, huh?

16:48.190 --> 16:50.886
Things were ominous,
so this is perfect.

16:58.834 --> 16:59.994
Amazing!

17:00.102 --> 17:01.865
Can you tell me your name?

17:01.971 --> 17:03.063
Arashi Kishu.

17:04.173 --> 17:06.937
I'm amazed a sword
came out of your hand!

17:07.042 --> 17:09.442
Where is it usually hidden?

17:09.545 --> 17:13.709
The missie from Ise and me are still
platonic so I'm not sure...

17:13.816 --> 17:14.714
Whoa!

17:15.985 --> 17:17.919
On kakaka bienmai sowaka...

17:18.020 --> 17:19.681
On kakaka bienmai sowaka!

17:22.958 --> 17:24.220
Pretty good!

17:24.326 --> 17:26.556
You must practice Mikkyou!

17:26.662 --> 17:28.630
I'm Sorata Arisugawa
from Kouya.

17:28.731 --> 17:30.130
You can call me Sora.

17:32.601 --> 17:33.499
Inuki!

17:50.319 --> 17:52.514
You're pretty useful
yourself, missie.

17:52.621 --> 17:55.681
If I recall correctly,
Mitsumine Shrine's...

17:55.791 --> 17:57.281
...name comes from
a priest at Shougoin,

17:57.393 --> 18:00.089
the Lord of Mitsumine.

18:00.195 --> 18:02.823
The one who worships the wolf
as their accompaniment.

18:02.931 --> 18:04.558
And that's why a dog spirit.

18:04.667 --> 18:06.828
Yup, I'm surprised
you know so much!

18:31.060 --> 18:32.118
Cherry petals?

18:33.662 --> 18:35.789
Sakurazukamori?

18:35.898 --> 18:38.594
So one of the Seven Angels is...

18:38.701 --> 18:40.168
...Sakurazukamori?

18:41.770 --> 18:42.737
Kamui!

18:42.838 --> 18:44.499
Kamui, please wait!

18:44.606 --> 18:46.096
I have nothing more to say.

18:47.176 --> 18:51.306
It was my mistake for not
handing you the Divine Sword.

18:51.413 --> 18:52.641
Please forgive me...

18:54.450 --> 18:58.011
And please become a Dragon of Heaven.
Save this world...

19:04.293 --> 19:04.987
Kamui...

19:08.797 --> 19:11.960
Princess, you can't
do anything about it.

19:12.067 --> 19:13.591
He's just a kid.

19:14.670 --> 19:17.264
Besides, nobody'd
be able to stand it...

19:17.372 --> 19:19.431
...if they were
suddenly handed the world.

19:19.541 --> 19:22.704
Even I think so,
and I'm one of the Seven Seals.

19:22.811 --> 19:24.438
You all think the same, right?

19:24.546 --> 19:26.241
Yes, I feel the same way!

19:26.348 --> 19:28.145
Yeah.

19:28.250 --> 19:32.016
Feeling confused after finding out
so many things can't be helped.

19:32.121 --> 19:33.486
But it'll be all right.

19:34.590 --> 19:37.753
Kamui still has things
he wants to protect.

20:13.128 --> 20:14.026
Kamui...

